      ":question/problem": "To which of the following sets does the number $\\sqrt{0}$ belong?\n\nI. $\\mathbb{Q}^{+}$\n\nII. $\\mathbb{C}$\n\nIII. $\\mathbb{Z}^{-}$\n\nIV. $\\mathbb{Z}^{+}$",
